Accomplished Operations Leader with history of continuous improvement and a strategic drive in the Power Industry · It was once said &quot;Your success in life isn&#39;t based on your ability to simply change. It is based on your ability to change faster than your competition, customers and business&quot;

Basing my career on the same quotation, I have an accomplished career of exceeding operational goals towards operations and Strategic Business Leadership. Armed with 20 years of experience representing the Operations and Maintenance function in senior management decision and key stakeholder meetings across business, operations and maintenance.

During the tenure, I have embraced the challenges as they arrived and been phenomenally successful in establishing, managing operations and maintenance of large power plants at leadership levels and led all functions like Finance &amp; Accounts, Stores &amp; Purchase, Personnel &amp; Administration, Liasioning &amp; Co-ordination, Contract Cell, Coal Handling Plant,

CRM | Mountain Guide | Outdoor Leader | Ex Business Owner · Experienced professional with a versatile background in Customer Relationship Management, Operations, Marketing, and Finance, demonstrated in roles at Century Real Estate, Amul, The Monk Ninja Adventures (TMNA), and Sowing Bean India. My career has been defined by a passion for simplifying complex problems and driving impactful solutions.

At Century Real Estate, I excel in managing client relationships, ensuring seamless communication, and delivering exceptional customer satisfaction. At Amul, I contributed to marketing strategies and operational efficiency, enhancing customer experiences. During my tenure at TMNA, I led expeditions and managed operations in high-risk environments, ensuring safety and client satisfaction. My experience at Sowing Bean India honed my skills in finance and business operations, further enriching my professional repertoire&quot;

Known for driving results and inspiring innovation, I take pride in fostering collaboration
